{"seq":1,"slug":"policy-rate-interest-corridor","title":"政策利率与利率走廊","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/monetary-policy-central-banking/monetary-policy-instruments/policy-rate-interest-corridor","wordCount":2981,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"政策利率与利率走廊\">政策利率与利率走廊</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>政策利率（Policy Rate）是央行向市场传递货币政策立场的核心信号，本质是银行间市场最短期限的利率。现代央行通过&quot;利率操作目标制&quot;，设定一个短期名义利率目标，再经由利率走廊的上下限约束把市场利率引导至目标附近，从而间接影响整条收益率曲线与实体经济。</p>\n<p>利率走廊（Interest Rate Corridor）由三个关键利率构成：<strong>上限</strong>是常备贷款便利利率（银行向央行借款的成本），<strong>下限</strong>是存款便利利率（银行将资金存入央行的收益），<strong>政策利率</strong>则设在走廊中间或接近中间，由央行的日常公开市场操作引导。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[贷款便利利率&lt;br/&gt;走廊上限] --&gt; B[市场利率波动区间]&#10;    C[存款便利利率&lt;br/&gt;走廊下限] --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; D[政策利率&lt;br/&gt;操作目标]&#10;    D --&gt; E[公开市场操作&lt;br/&gt;调节银行体系流动性]&#10;    E --&gt; F[银行间市场利率锚定目标]&#10;    F --&gt; G[通过预期假说影响收益率曲线]&#10;    G --&gt; H[借贷成本/储蓄收益变化]&#10;    H --&gt; I[总需求·产出·物价]\">graph TD\n    A[贷款便利利率&lt;br/&gt;走廊上限] --&gt; B[市场利率波动区间]\n    C[存款便利利率&lt;br/&gt;走廊下限] --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; D[政策利率&lt;br/&gt;操作目标]\n    D --&gt; E[公开市场操作&lt;br/&gt;调节银行体系流动性]\n    E --&gt; F[银行间市场利率锚定目标]\n    F --&gt; G[通过预期假说影响收益率曲线]\n    G --&gt; H[借贷成本/储蓄收益变化]\n    H --&gt; I[总需求·产出·物价]</pre><p>走廊宽度体现政策取舍：窄走廊（如±25bp）控制更精确但需更频繁的操作；宽走廊（如±100bp）减轻操作负担但信号不够精确。2008年后，美联储转向&quot;地板系统&quot;，以超额准备金利率（IORB）直接充当利率下限，市场利率紧贴下限运行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"政策利率的核心地位\">政策利率的核心地位</h2><p>政策利率（Policy Rate）是中央银行向市场传递货币政策立场的核心信号。在现代货币政策框架中，央行通过设定一个短期名义利率目标，间接影响整个利率体系，进而作用于消费、投资和通胀。这一操作范式被称为&quot;利率操作目标制&quot;，已取代早期的货币数量目标制成为全球主流。</p>\n<p>不同央行的政策利率名称各异，但其本质类似——都是银行间市场最短期限的利率：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>央行</th>\n<th>政策利率名称</th>\n<th>当前目标形式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>美联储</td>\n<td>联邦基金利率（Federal Funds Rate）</td>\n<td>目标区间（如5.25%-5.50%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧洲央行</td>\n<td>主要再融资操作利率（MRO Rate）</td>\n<td>点目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英格兰银行</td>\n<td>银行利率（Bank Rate）</td>\n<td>点目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中国人民银行</td>\n<td>7天逆回购操作利率</td>\n<td>操作利率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日本银行</td>\n<td>无担保隔夜拆借利率</td>\n<td>目标区间（含负利率时期）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>政策利率之所以能影响整个经济，是因为短期利率是所有金融资产定价的基础。根据预期假说（Expectations Hypothesis），长期利率大致等于预期的未来短期利率的平均值加上期限溢价：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_n = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{t=0}^{n-1} E_t(i_{1,t+j}) + \\theta_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0682em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 期利率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_t(i_{1,t+j})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 时刻对未来短期利率的预期，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为期限溢价。央行通过改变当前政策利率和引导市场对未来利率路径的预期，来影响整条收益率曲线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"利率走廊系统的运作机制\">利率走廊系统的运作机制</h2><p>利率走廊（Interest Rate Corridor）系统是现代央行引导短期市场利率的操作框架。其基本原理是：央行设定一个利率上限（贷款便利利率）和一个利率下限（存款便利利率），市场利率在这一&quot;走廊&quot;内波动。</p>\n<p><strong>走廊的上限</strong>通常是央行的常备贷款便利（Standing Lending Facility）利率。当银行间市场利率上升至接近这一水平时，银行会转向央行借款（因为央行贷款更便宜），从而自动阻止市场利率进一步上行。</p>\n<p><strong>走廊的下限</strong>是央行的存款便利（Deposit Facility）利率。当银行间市场利率下降至接近这一水平时，银行会选择将多余资金存入央行（因为收益更高），从而阻止市场利率进一步下行。</p>\n<p><strong>政策利率</strong>通常设在走廊中间或接近中间的位置。央行通过日常的公开市场操作调节银行体系的总流动性，将市场利率引导至政策利率附近。</p>\n<p>走廊宽度的设定体现了政策取舍。窄走廊（如±25个基点）提供了更精确的利率控制，但要求央行进行更频繁的流动性操作来维持市场利率在目标附近。宽走廊（如±100个基点）允许更大的利率波动，减轻了央行的操作负担，但政策信号不够精确。</p>\n<p>不同央行采用了不同的走廊设计：</p>\n<p><strong>对称走廊</strong>：欧洲央行传统上使用对称走廊，存款便利利率和贷款便利利率分别在MRO利率上下各50个基点。</p>\n<p><strong>地板系统</strong>（Floor System）：2008年后美联储转向地板系统——超额准备金利率（IOER/IORB）充当利率下限，市场利率紧贴下限运行。这一转变的背景是量化宽松后银行体系准备金极度充裕，传统的通过调节稀缺准备金来控制利率的方法不再适用。</p>\n<p><strong>中国的多利率体系</strong>：中国人民银行的利率走廊以常备借贷便利（SLF）利率为上限，超额准备金利率为下限，7天逆回购操作利率为政策目标。2019年贷款市场报价利率（LPR）改革后，政策利率向贷款利率的传导链条进一步理顺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"泰勒规则与政策利率设定\">泰勒规则与政策利率设定</h2><p>如何决定政策利率的适当水平？约翰·泰勒（John Taylor）在1993年提出的泰勒规则（Taylor Rule）为这一问题提供了一个简明的参照框架：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_t = r^* + \\pi_t + 0.5(\\pi_t - \\pi^*) + 0.5(y_t - y_t^*)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.822em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为政策利率</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为实际均衡利率（通常假设为2%）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为当前通胀率</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为通胀目标（通常为2%）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_t - y_t^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9357em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为产出缺口（实际GDP与潜在GDP之差的百分比）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>泰勒规则的含义直观：当通胀高于目标时，央行应加息（系数0.5意味着通胀每超1个百分点，名义利率应提高1.5个百分点，使实际利率上升0.5个百分点）；当产出低于潜在水平时，央行应降息以刺激经济。</p>\n<p>泰勒原则（Taylor Principle）——名义利率对通胀的反应系数应大于1——是确保货币政策稳定的关键条件。如果反应系数小于1，通胀上升时实际利率反而下降，形成不稳定的正反馈循环。实证研究表明，沃尔克之前的美联储政策未能满足泰勒原则，可能是1970年代大通胀的制度根源之一。</p>\n<p>泰勒规则并非刻板的公式，而是政策讨论的基准。实际决策中，央行还需考虑：金融稳定风险、外部冲击的性质（需求冲击vs供给冲击）、模型不确定性、通胀预期是否锚定等因素。许多央行在内部使用泰勒规则的变体作为参考，但明确表示不会机械地遵循任何单一规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"负利率政策的突破与争议\">负利率政策的突破与争议</h2><p>2014年6月，欧洲央行首次将存款便利利率降至零以下（-0.10%），开创了主要央行实施负利率政策（Negative Interest Rate Policy, NIRP）的先河。随后，瑞士、瑞典、丹麦和日本也相继采用负利率。这一突破打破了长期以来&quot;零是利率下限&quot;的信条。</p>\n<p>负利率的逻辑是：当经济处于深度衰退且通缩风险上升时，即使名义利率降至零仍不够宽松——实际利率（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mi>e</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = i - \\pi^e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）可能仍然过高。通过将政策利率推入负区间，央行试图进一步降低实际利率，刺激借贷和支出。</p>\n<p><strong>传导机制</strong>：负利率主要通过以下渠道发挥作用：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>对银行超额准备金征收&quot;费用&quot;，激励银行将资金贷出而非存放在央行</li>\n<li>压低短期收益率曲线，通过预期效应影响中长期利率</li>\n<li>促进本币贬值（利差缩小 → 资本外流 → 汇率贬值）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>实施效果与副作用</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>短期利率和政府债券收益率确实降入负区间（德国10年期国债收益率在2019年低至约-0.70%）</li>\n<li>但银行存贷利差被压缩，银行盈利能力下降</li>\n<li>零售存款利率难以降至零以下（银行担心存款流失），传导出现&quot;断层&quot;</li>\n<li>现金囤积的&quot;有效下限&quot;约束——如果负利率过深，经济主体可能转向持有实物现金</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>逆转利率</strong>（Reversal Rate）是Brunnermeier和Koby（2018）提出的概念：当利率降低到某个阈值以下时，进一步降息反而会收缩（而非扩张）银行信贷供给——因为银行净利息收入的减少超过了贷款需求的增加。如果逆转利率确实存在，则负利率政策存在一个自然的效力边界。</p>\n<p>2022年后全球通胀回升，欧洲央行和瑞士央行相继退出负利率。日本银行在2024年3月结束了持续8年的负利率政策。这段实验的全面评估仍在进行中，但初步结论是：负利率在浅负区间有一定效果，但深度负利率的边际效益递减且副作用增大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自然利率与政策空间\">自然利率与政策空间</h2><p>理解政策利率的适当水平还需要一个关键的锚定概念——自然利率（Natural Rate of Interest），通常记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。维克塞尔（Knut Wicksell, 1898）最早提出这一概念：自然利率是使经济保持充分就业且物价稳定的实际利率水平。当市场实际利率低于自然利率时，经济趋向过热和通胀；反之则趋向衰退和通缩。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的估计对货币政策至关重要。如果自然利率为2%且通胀目标为2%，则&quot;中性&quot;名义政策利率约为4%。如果自然利率仅为0.5%，则中性利率仅约2.5%，政策在面对衰退时的降息空间大幅缩小。</p>\n<p>多项研究（Laubach &amp; Williams, 2003; Holston, Laubach &amp; Williams, 2017）发现，过去几十年全球主要经济体的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 呈趋势性下降。驱动因素包括：人口老龄化（储蓄增加）、生产率增长放缓（投资需求下降）、全球&quot;储蓄过剩&quot;（Global Savings Glut）、安全资产需求上升等。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的下降是零利率下限约束频繁束缚货币政策的深层结构原因。</p>\n<p>如何应对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下降导致的政策空间缩窄，是当代货币政策框架讨论的核心议题。可能的应对包括：提高通胀目标（从2%到4%）以增加降息空间、采用价格水平目标或平均通胀目标、依赖非常规工具作为常规补充、以及通过结构性改革提升 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>政策利率是银行间最短期限利率，央行借&quot;利率操作目标制&quot;通过它影响整条收益率曲线与实体经济。</li>\n<li>利率走廊以贷款便利为上限、存款便利为下限、政策利率居中，市场利率被约束在走廊内波动。</li>\n<li>走廊宽窄、对称与否以及地板系统的选择，体现不同央行在控制精度与操作负担之间的取舍。</li>\n<li>泰勒规则为政策利率设定提供基准，其核心是&quot;泰勒原则&quot;——名义利率对通胀的反应系数应大于1。</li>\n<li>负利率政策打破了&quot;零是下限&quot;的信条，但存在逆转利率等效力边界，且传导在零售存款端出现断层。</li>\n<li>自然利率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的趋势性下降是政策空间收窄的深层原因，也是通胀目标制改革讨论的出发点。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"政策利率与利率走廊","id":"政策利率与利率走廊"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"政策利率的核心地位","id":"政策利率的核心地位"},{"level":2,"text":"利率走廊系统的运作机制","id":"利率走廊系统的运作机制"},{"level":2,"text":"泰勒规则与政策利率设定","id":"泰勒规则与政策利率设定"},{"level":2,"text":"负利率政策的突破与争议","id":"负利率政策的突破与争议"},{"level":2,"text":"自然利率与政策空间","id":"自然利率与政策空间"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"最后贷款人与金融稳定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/monetary-policy-central-banking/central-banking-system/lender-of-last-resort"},"next":{"title":"公开市场操作与准备金管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/monetary-policy-central-banking/monetary-policy-instruments/open-market-operations"}}